      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy though. like every single thing i do feels fake. i walk around the house and everything is just a reminder of how much of \"me\" was actually just us. it's not even just being sad, it's like my soul actually left with him. i feel like i'm already dead, just stuck in this body that keeps moving.",
