    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it gets better but i just dont see it. it's like i'm waiting for a life that's already over. nothing feels real. it's like i'm just haunting my own life. does it ever actually stop feeling like you're just waiting to catch up to the person you lost?",
