      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that it \"gets better\" is a cliché, and it doesn't address the deep, raw reality of what you're feeling right now. You aren't just waiting to catch up; you are actively experiencing the aftermath of a massive life shift, and that takes time to rewire. Instead of waiting for a past self to return, focus on the next small moment—a sip of water, a breath—and see if you can give yourself permission to just *be* in that moment without judgment.",
